	(text "Optocoupler wired-OR: LOW = recent audio. 103ms nominal release RC.\nFirmware must require 500ms persistence, then time 10min silence.\nBlank detection at startup, source changes and after power-off.\nDo not count a single edge/click as continuous audio."
